msgid "Convert Markdown to WeChat public account HTML"
msgstr "将 Markdown 文档转换为微信公众号 HTML"

msgid "Convert a Markdown file to HTML format suitable for WeChat public accounts.\n\nThe conversion process:\n  1. Parse the Markdown file using goldmark (supports GFM tables, strikethrough)\n  2. Inject inline CSS styles on every element (required by WeChat)\n  3. Save the result as <filename>.html\n\nWith --upload:\n  4. Parse local image references from the HTML\n  5. Upload images to WeChat material management (with caching via images.yaml)\n  6. Update image URLs in the HTML\n\nWeChat only supports inline styles and a limited set of HTML elements.\nThis command handles all common Markdown syntax:\n  - Headings (h1-h4), paragraphs, blockquotes\n  - Bold, italic, inline code, strikethrough\n  - Fenced code blocks with syntax highlighting\n  - Links and images\n  - Ordered and unordered lists\n  - Tables (GFM-style)\n  - Thematic breaks (hr)\n  - Raw HTML passthrough (footnotes, etc.)"
msgstr "将 Markdown 文件转换为适合微信公众号展示的 HTML 格式。\n\n转换过程:\n  1. 使用 goldmark 解析 Markdown 文件（支持 GFM 表格、删除线）\n  2. 在每个元素上注入内联 CSS 样式（微信编辑器要求）\n  3. 将结果保存为 <filename>.html\n\n使用 --upload:\n  4. 从 HTML 中提取本地图片引用\n  5. 上传图片到微信素材管理（通过 images.yaml 缓存避免重复上传）\n  6. 更新 HTML 中的图片 URL\n\n微信只支持内联样式和有限的 HTML 元素。\n本命令支持所有常见的 Markdown 语法:\n  - 标题 (h1-h4)、段落、引用\n  - 粗体、斜体、行内代码、删除线\n  - 围栏代码块（无语法高亮类）\n  - 链接和图片\n  - 有序和无序列表\n  - 表格 (GFM 风格)\n  - 分隔线 (hr)\n  - 原始 HTML 透传（脚注等）"

