# draft command long description
msgid ""
"Manage WeChat public account drafts.\n"
"\n"
"The \"add\" command saves the returned media_id to a sidecar YAML file\n"
"(<file>.yaml) alongside the HTML file. Subsequent \"update\" commands\n"
"can then use just the HTML file path — the media_id is read from the\n"
"sidecar YAML automatically. If no sidecar exists, the first draft in\n"
"the list is used as a default.\n"
"\n"
"Subcommands:\n"
"	hILz   list              List all drafts\n"
"	7ckj   add    <file>     Create a new draft from .org/.md/.html (auto-converts if needed)\n"
"	qbD5   update <file>     Update a draft from .org/.md/.html (auto-converts if needed)\n"
"  remove <id>       Remove a draft (id, index, or file with sidecar YAML)\n"
"  show   <id>       Show a draft's details (id, index, or file with sidecar YAML)\n"
"  convert <file>    Convert Markdown to WeChat HTML format\n"
msgstr ""
"管理微信公众号草稿。\n"
"\n"
"\"add\" 命令将返回的 media_id 保存到 sidecar YAML 文件（<file>.yaml）中，\n"
"与 HTML 文件放在一起。后续的 \"update\" 命令只需传入 HTML 文件路径，\n"
"media_id 会自动从 sidecar YAML 读取。如果没有 sidecar，\n"
"则使用列表中的第一个草稿作为默认值。\n"
"\n"
"子命令：\n"
"	hILz   list              列出所有草稿\n"
"	7ckj   add    <file>     从 .org/.md/.html 创建新草稿（自动转换格式）\n"
"	qbD5   update <file>     从 .org/.md/.html 更新草稿\n"
"  remove <id>       删除草稿（ID、索引或含 sidecar YAML 的文件路径）\n"
"  show   <id>       查看草稿详情（ID、索引或含 sidecar YAML 的文件路径）\n"
"  convert <file>    将 Markdown 转换为微信 HTML 格式\n"

