# Site command long description
msgid ""
"Manage static site deployment targets with type-specific workflows.\n"
"\n"
"Each site has a local directory and optional configuration keys (dir, rsync, etc.).\n"
"Site types:\n"
"  page (default)  — Ongoing page additions, rsync from site dir directly.\n"
"  zine            — Zine-generated site, auto-builds before rsync, rsync from public/.\n"
"\n"
"Subcommands:\n"
"  list                  List all configured sites\n"
"  add    <name> ...     Add a new site with key=value pairs\n"
"  update <name> <k> <v> Update a site's configuration key\n"
"  remove <name>         Remove a site\n"
"  optimize <name>       Optimize site CSS for responsive display\n"
"  rsync  <name>         Deploy site via rsync (auto-builds zine, optimizes CSS)\n"
msgstr ""
"管理具有类型特定工作流的静态站点部署目标。\n"
"\n"
"每个站点有一个本地目录和可选配置键（dir、rsync 等）。\n"
"站点类型：\n"
"  page（默认）— 持续添加页面，直接从站点目录 rsync。\n"
"  zine        — Zine 生成的站点，rsync 前自动构建，从 public/ 目录 rsync。\n"
"\n"
"子命令：\n"
"  list                  列出所有已配置的站点\n"
"  add    <name> ...     添加新站点，键=值对\n"
"  update <name> <k> <v> 更新站点的配置键\n"
"  remove <name>         删除站点\n"
"  optimize <name>       优化站点 CSS 以适应响应式显示\n"
"  rsync  <name>         通过 rsync 部署站点（自动构建 zine、优化 CSS）\n"

# Description heading
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "说明:"

# site add long description
msgid ""
"Add a new deployment site with key-value configuration pairs.\n"
"\n"
"The first positional argument is the site name. Subsequent arguments are\n"
"key-value pairs for site configuration.\n"
"\n"
"Required keys:\n"
"  dir   Local site directory\n"
"\n"
"Optional keys:\n"
"  rsync Rsync deployment command\n"
"  type  Site type: page (default) or zine (auto-build before rsync, public/ output)\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  slingshot site add mysite dir ~/mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path' type zine"
msgstr ""
"添加新的部署站点，使用键值对配置。\n"
"\n"
"第一个位置参数是站点名称，后续参数是站点的键值对配置。\n"
"\n"
"必填键：\n"
"  dir   本地站点目录\n"
"\n"
"可选键：\n"
"  rsync Rsync 部署命令\n"
"  type  站点类型：page（默认）或 zine（rsync 前自动构建，输出 public/）\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  slingshot site add mysite dir ~/mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path' type zine"

# site update long description
msgid ""
"Update a single configuration field on an existing site.\n"
"\n"
"Arguments:\n"
"  <name>  Site name\n"
"  <key>   Configuration key (e.g. dir, rsync)\n"
"  <value> New value\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  slingshot site update mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path'"
msgstr ""
"更新现有站点的单个配置字段。\n"
"\n"
"参数：\n"
"  <name>  站点名称\n"
"  <key>   配置键（如 dir、rsync）\n"
"  <value> 新值\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  slingshot site update mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path'"

# site rsync long description
msgid ""
"Run the configured rsync command to deploy site content to remote.\n"
"\n"
"For zine-type sites, automatically runs 'zine build' before rsync\n"
"and executes rsync from the 'public/' output directory.\n"
"For page-type sites, rsync runs directly from the site directory."
msgstr ""
"运行已配置的 rsync 命令将站点内容部署到远程。\n"
"\n"
"对于 zine 类型站点，自动在 rsync 前运行 'zine build'\n"
"并从 'public/' 输出目录执行 rsync。\n"
"对于 page 类型站点，直接从站点目录 rsync。"

